    "abilities": [
        "Dakka Dakka Dakka, Squadron, Waaagh!",
        "Grot Gunner: A weapon with a Grot gunner is fired with a BS of 4+.",
        "Mek weapon: This weapon's profile cannot be changed by equipment or wargear.",
        "Pointy Bitz: The model inflicts D6 hits with S:6 AP:-2 D:1 when it makes a Charge move.",
        "Ramshackle: Roll on the table when the vehicle is destroyed.",
        "\"1-3\"",
        "Kaboom! The vehicle explodes with a radius of 6\".",
        "\"4-6\"",
        "Kareen! Move the vehicle 3D6\" in a random direction and then execute Kaboom! The vehicle stops at the first unit (friendly or enemy!) instead of moving the distance rolled.  If the scatter die is a hit symbol, the controlling player can decide the direction.",
        "If the vehicle has been immobilized, the controlling player can roll with any command on the \"Ramshackle\" table in the next activation and apply the result.",
        "Shokk Rifle: Roll for the strength of the weapon after you have selected a target. If doubles are rolled, consult the following table:",
        "2D6",
        "Result",
        "\"1,1\"",
        "Boom! The warbuggy receives an automatic hit with S: D AP: -4 D: 3.        ",
        "\"2,2\"",
        "Gah! The new target is the nearest visible unit that is not engaged in melee combat (including Ork units!).        ",
        "\"3,3\"",
        "Oops! An opponent chooses a new target (including Ork units!).        ",
        "\"4,4\"",
        "Sploosh! The weapon changes its profile to Assault 2, S: 6 AP: -3 D: 1, Blast(4), Suppression(3).",
        "\"5,5\"",
        "Zoink! Remove the warbuggy from the field and immediately redeploy it according to the rules for Deep strike. It can no longer move, but can still shoot.        ",
        "\"6,6\"",
        "Bzzap! The weapon fires with Strength: D and AT(3) and loses the Blast(4) rule for this activation.        ",
        "Shokk Tunnel: When an \"Advance\" command is given, instead of moving the model an additional 1D6\", a model with this weapon is removed from the board and immediately repositioned according to the rules for Deep Strike. Then roll 1D6. On a 1 or 2, the model suffers a penetrating hit."
